 de l'identite des prix. J'ai etabli, au contraire, que la reconduction doit embrasser la periode necessaire pour la perception de tous les fruits de l'heritagej par: oosequet1t, chacune des annees-comprises au nouveau bail presentera la moyenne des produits du fondson n'aura plus-a comparer la production la plus elevee avec la plus basse, mais seulement avec la moyenne. Il y aura bien encore une difference; mais elle sera moindre que celle que Pothier, en habile dialecticien, prend pour theme de son argumentation, afin de foire...\nContent provided by Syndetic Solutions, Inc. Terms of Use\n... ( see more )\n\n    Subjects\n    Location\n    Table of Contents\n    MARC\n    Full Record\n\nSubjects\nHaeg, Fritz -- Friends and associates.\nSundown Salon.\nArts -- California -- Los Angeles -- 21st century.\nGroup work in art.\nBinding method -- Accordion fold.\nPrinting / production method -- Commercial production.\nArtists' books.\nArtists' books -- California.\nAccordion fold format (Binding)\n\nOther Author: \tHaeg, Fritz.\nLocation\nOnline\nLocation \tCall # \tStatus \tNotes\nArt Library Artists' Book Collection \tN7433.4.A1 S86 2009 \tIn-Library Use Only \t\nTable of Contents\nPublisher's foreword / by Stacy Wakefield -- Welcome / by Fritz Haeg -- Light & space / by Malik Gaines -- American Homebody / by Lisa Anne Auerbach -- Castles in the air / by Matias Viegener -- Trannies, grass & literature / by Trinie Dalton -- Informed invention, formed informally / by Kimberli Meyer -- Home work / by Robby Herbst.\nMARC\nLEADER 00000cam  2200469Ma 4500 \n001    590153343 \n003    OCoLC \n005    20100615084216.0 \n008    071217s2009    nyua          000 0 eng   \n010      2007051644 \n020    9780976335511 \n020    0976335514 \n035    (OCoLC)590153343 \n040    DLC|cN15|dNOC \n043    n-us-ca \n049    NOCA \n050 00 NX511.L67|bS86 2009 \n050  4 N7433.4.A1|bS86 2009 \n082 00 700.9794/94|222 \n245 04 The Sundown Salon unfolding archive :|ba project /|cby \n       Fritz Haeg. \n2